### Alo Credit - Mock Backend
### Archivo para la extension "REST Client" de VS Code (humao.rest-client).
### Ejecuta cada peticion con "Send Request" (aparece sobre cada bloque ###).
### El login guarda el token en la variable @token para las demas peticiones.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000

### 0. Health check (publico)
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### 1. Login OK -> guarda el token
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "documento": "123456789",
  "pin": "1234"
}

### Variable con el token del login anterior
@token = {{login.response.body.token}}

### 1b. Login con credenciales invalidas -> 401
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "documento": "000000000",
  "pin": "9999"
}

### 2. Listar creditos (requiere token)
GET {{baseUrl}}/loans
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 2b. Listar creditos SIN token -> 401
GET {{baseUrl}}/loans

### 2c. Simular latencia de 2 segundos
GET {{baseUrl}}/loans?delay=2000
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 2d. Forzar error 500
GET {{baseUrl}}/loans?fail=true
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 3. Detalle de credito con plan de pagos
GET {{baseUrl}}/loans/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 3b. Detalle de credito inexistente -> 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/loans/999
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 4. Solicitud de credito APROBADA (monto <= 2.000.000)
POST {{baseUrl}}/loan-applications
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "monto": 1500000,
  "cuotas": 12
}

### 4b. Solicitud EN_REVISION (monto > 2.000.000)
POST {{baseUrl}}/loan-applications
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "monto": 3500000,
  "cuotas": 18
}

### 4c. Solicitud invalida -> 422 (detalle por campo)
POST {{baseUrl}}/loan-applications
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "monto": 50000,
  "cuotas": 36
}
